Dash2Dock Motion
================

This program is a modified copy of Dash to Dock v105
(https://github.com/micheleg/dash-to-dock) by Michele Gaio (micheleg) and
contributors, which supplies the dock core: docking, autohide, intellihide,
struts, theming, app icons and preferences.

The magnification engine (magnifier.js) and the glass slab (glass.js) are
original to this program. Work on the launch bounce and per-frame icon
transforms was informed by Dash2Dock Animated
(https://github.com/icedman/dash2dock-lite) by icedman.

